{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださり、ありがとうございます☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生\n埼玉県出身21歳の浅井恋乃未（あさいこのみ）です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "順番が前後してしまいますが…"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "リアルミート&グリート、会場まで足を運んでくれてありがとうございました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年も浴衣を着てみました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさん褒めてくれて嬉しかった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "着てよかった！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑さも人混みもそこまで得意ではありませんが、お祭りとか、花火とか、夏らしいことたくさんしたくなりました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちなみに、小さい頃はお祭りに行ったら牛串を絶対に食べてました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobeWY7z4.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobfTy0H5.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobD5ISxy.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobbV3jQn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobfoenIR.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "可愛くて綺麗でとっても素敵な祝花に、素敵なメッセージを添えてくださって、すごくほっこりしました☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobQuIX8g.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/mobcypMFY.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202607/moblonE2B.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "オンラインミート&グリートの写真たち"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お家にあったデジカメで撮ってみました\n新しいカメラを探しているのですが、これもいいなーあれもいいなーとなってしまい決まらなさそうです…\nこのカメラの質感も好きなのでしばらくはこれを使おうかな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月から7月にかけてお話しできる日がたくさんあって、嬉しかったです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアー前にお話しできるのは次の7月12日が最後ですね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちーたんとペアレーンです☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってるよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#45"}], "source": "official"}